--- Draws the current animation frame without advancing playback.
---@param image? LImage Texture atlas or spritesheet; omit when an image was stored with setImage.
---@param x? number Destination X position (default 0).
---@param y? number Destination Y position (default 0).
---@param opts? table Optional transform table with numeric `rotation`, `scale`, `scaleX`, `scaleY`, `originX`, and `originY` fields.
---@return boolean True when a frame draw command was queued; false when no current frame is active.
